      "we believe this is due to some extent to the practice of litigation funding, whereby insured parties \"sell\" their rights under a policy to a group of investors (often lawyers) who simply try to maximise the claims payments",
      "social inflation should not be overlooked",
      "increases in claims year on year have continued whereas all earlier years show a slowing pattern of claims growth",
